 var font=new ComboBox{DropDownStyle=ComboBoxStyle.DropDownList};font.Items.AddRange(FontFamily.Families.Select(x=>x.Name).OrderBy(x=>x).Cast<object>().ToArray());font.SelectedItem=obs.style.font;if(font.SelectedIndex<0)font.SelectedIndex=0;add("Font",font);
 var size=new NumericUpDown{Minimum=12,Maximum=40,Value=obs.style.size};add("Text size",size);var emote=new NumericUpDown{Minimum=16,Maximum=64,Value=obs.style.emote};add("Emote size",emote);
 var colors=new Dictionary<string,Button>();foreach(string key in new[]{"text","name","background"}){string initial=(string)typeof(ChatAppearance).GetField(key).GetValue(obs.style);var b=Button(initial,delegate{});b.Tag=initial;b.Click+=delegate{using(var picker=new ColorDialog{Color=ColorTranslator.FromHtml((string)b.Tag)})if(picker.ShowDialog(w)==DialogResult.OK){b.Tag=ColorTranslator.ToHtml(picker.Color);if(((string)b.Tag)[0]!='#')b.Tag=String.Format("#{0:X2}{1:X2}{2:X2}",picker.Color.R,picker.Color.G,picker.Color.B);b.Text=(string)b.Tag;}};colors[key]=b;add(key=="name"?"Sender colour":key=="text"?"Text colour":"Background colour",b);}
 var transparent=new CheckBox{Checked=obs.style.transparent};add("Transparent OBS overlay",transparent);var stamps=new CheckBox{Checked=obs.style.timestamps};add("Show times",stamps);var platforms=new CheckBox{Checked=obs.style.platforms};add("Show platforms",platforms);var limit=new NumericUpDown{Minimum=1,Maximum=100,Value=obs.style.limit};add("Overlay message limit",limit);var duration=new NumericUpDown{Minimum=0,Maximum=600,Value=obs.style.duration};add("Hide after seconds (0 = keep)",duration);
 add("",Button("Apply",delegate{obs.style.font=(string)font.SelectedItem;obs.style.size=(int)size.Value;obs.style.emote=(int)emote.Value;obs.style.text=(string)colors["text"].Tag;obs.style.name=(string)colors["name"].Tag;obs.style.background=(string)colors["background"].Tag;obs.style.transparent=transparent.Checked;obs.style.timestamps=stamps.Checked;obs.style.platforms=platforms.Checked;obs.style.limit=(int)limit.Value;obs.style.duration=(int)duration.Value;ApplyChatAppearance();try{SaveObs();w.Close();}catch{MessageBox.Show(w,"Could not save preferences. Unlock your Windows profile and try again.");}}));w.ShowDialog(this);}}
 void ShowObs(){try{StartObs();}catch(Exception e){MessageBox.Show(this,e.Message,"OBS connection");return;}using(var w=new Form{Text="Connect chat to OBS",Size=new Size(720,480),StartPosition=FormStartPosition.CenterParent,BackColor=Theme.Canvas,ForeColor=Theme.Text,Font=Font}){var grid=new FlowLayoutPanel{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,FlowDirection=FlowDirection.TopDown,WrapContents=false,Padding=new Padding(24),AutoScroll=true};w.Controls.Add(grid);grid.Controls.Add(new Label{Text="Keep this app open on the same computer as OBS.\nDock: OBS > Docks > Custom Browser Docks.\nOverlay: Sources > + > Browser. Paste the matching link.",Size=new Size(650,85),ForeColor=Theme.Text});Action<string,string> link=(name,path)=>{grid.Controls.Add(new Label{Text=name,AutoSize=true});var text=new TextBox{ReadOnly=true,Width=640,Text="http://127.0.0.1:"+ObsPort+path+"#"+obs.token};grid.Controls.Add(text);grid.Controls.Add(Button("Copy "+name,delegate{Clipboard.SetText(text.Text);}));};link("dock link","/dock");grid.Controls.Add(Button("Copy UniversalCollab chat + send link",delegate{Clipboard.SetText("http://127.0.0.1:"+ObsPort+"/dock#"+obs.token+"."+obs.sendToken);}));link("overlay link","/overlay");grid.Controls.Add(Button("Stop OBS connection",delegate{obs.enabled=false;obsServer.Dispose();obsServer=null;try{SaveObs();}catch{}w.Close();}));grid.Controls.Add(Button("Reset links",delegate{obsServer.Dispose();obsServer=null;obs.token="";obs.sendToken="";try{StartObs();w.Close();MessageBox.Show(this,"Links changed. Open OBS setup again to copy the new links.");}catch(Exception e){MessageBox.Show(w,e.Message);}}));w.ShowDialog(this);}}
